It's kind of like leapfrogging.

00:33:02.900 --> 00:33:04.210
I understand that cold.

00:33:04.210 --> 00:33:06.410
Especially the hardware-software dynamic

00:33:06.410 --> 00:33:08.280
that I think you've been
through the last 15 years

00:33:08.280 --> 00:33:10.110
makes all the sense to me in the world.

