The baseball cards, I
was really into that,

00:33:31.180 --> 00:33:35.827
Especially baseball, I think
is really like the nerds game

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:37.803
'cause it's so.

00:33:37.803 --> 00:33:38.650
- It's math.

00:33:38.650 --> 00:33:39.510
You're a nerd, Mark.

00:33:39.510 --> 00:33:41.580
- It's so mathematic.

